      "description": "Sample playbooks for the \"Fortinet FortiAIGate\" connector. If you are planning to use the sample playbooks in your environment, ensure that you clone those playbooks and move them to a different collection, since the sample playbook collection gets deleted during connector upgrade and delete.",
